DESCRIPTION:Ashley Hope Pérez will discuss her recent book\, Banned Togethe
 r: Our Fight for Readers’ Rights\, and how censorship impacts literacy and
  education. She will also discuss the value of adopting a pro-literacy ori
 entation to support young people today. The discussion will be moderated b
 y MCPL staff with a book signing to follow. Books for purchase will be pro
 vided by Redbud Books. Age 12 and up.
