DESCRIPTION:The iRide is a no drop ride with regroup points geared toward t
 he rider wanting to push the pace a bit without being race oriented. 16-18m
 ph avg on most rides. We typically follow the OWLS group route and add some
  extra miles/climbs in the second half of the route allowing folks to start
  out with us and if we are too fast they can drop back to the OWLS group. A
 ll interested in a brisker pace are welcome!\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/rou
 tes/54319744\n\nNon-members should sign up for a free trial membership of u
 p to one month and sign a liability waiver before participating in a club r
 ide. https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=141883
