DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 ://www.strava.com/routes/3266072786586602498&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar
 &amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1oICBNLxC4-eLKObdG7eKC" target="_blank">30 Handy
  Ramp Creek Strain Ridge Popcorn Ketcham Victor</a></u><br></p><p>BV Ride i
 s an intermediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not 
 include regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occas
 ional sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, interval
 s\, and fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking
  lot across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will inc
 rease as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!
 </p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ri
 de maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar wit
 h the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sig
 n up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregist
 ered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calend
 ar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3NeoFlWD_1flG-21SFUgXK" target="_blank">free t
 rial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elect
 ronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20260330T161244Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, U
 SA
