 ors open at 5:30 p.m. and the presentation begins at 6 p.m. A reception wi
 ll follow\, offering residents the opportunity to engage with city leaders
 hip\, neighbors\, and community partners.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>The Sta
 te of the City is an annual address that provides an update on Bloomington
