DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Live Reality Games @ IU\n\n&nbsp\; Celebrate the st
 art of Survivor 50 with a watch party honoring 25 years of blindsides\, id
 ols\, and unforgettable moments. Join us as we watch and discuss the LIVE 
 season premiere of Survivor's 50th season\, with riveting conversation and
  maybe food. We'll see.&nbsp\; Whether you're only watching because you th
 ink Colby is hot\, or you're excited to see Cirie lose for the eighth time
 \, our event is open to Survivor fans new and old! Great way to meet fun p
 eople and a good hang on a Wednesday night.
LOCATION:Ballentine Hall\, BH 343
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12120726
