SUMMARY:IU Arts and Humanities First Thursday Performance by Eleanor & Dario
DESCRIPTION:Thursday April 2nd\nEvent Time: 4:00 – 7:00 PM\nPerformance Time: TBD\nIU Fine Arts Plaza \nFree to the Public \nView the full event program \nAbout Eleanor & Dario\nEleanor Dubinsky (cello\, vocals) and Darío Acosta Teich (guitar) take audiences on a trip around the world with multilingual original songs and fresh interpretations of jazz and beloved classics in Spanish\, French\, Portuguese. Their elegant performances transcend genre and geography\, celebrating the beautiful diversity of our world. They serve as cultural ambassadors via the US Department of State Bureau of Educational and Cultural Affairs Arts Envoy program and African Regional Services. \n \n 
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/iu-arts-and-humanities-first-thursday-performance-by-eleanor-dario/
LOCATION:IU Fine Arts Plaza\, 1296 E 7th St\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47405\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lotus Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ELEANOR-AND-DARIO-HORIZ-TAMBOURINE_CREDIT-ALEX-KOROLKOVAS.webp
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lotus Festival": "https://www.lotusfest.org/event/lotus-lanterns/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lotusfest
X-SOURCE:Lotus Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260402T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260402T190000
DTSTAMP:20260331T221147
CREATED:20260310T222448Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260310T222448Z
UID:27151-1775145600-1775156400@www.lotusfest.org
SUMMARY:Lotus Lanterns
DESCRIPTION:Date: April 2\nTime: 4:00 to 7:00 p.m.\nLocation: IU First Thursday\nJoin us for a night of crafting as we explore the art of lantern making! Leading the project our OLP student Kate will be teaching and assisting you to make a beautiful Lotus Lantern out of recycled materials and paper. Bring your own plastic bottle or use one we’ve collected and share what makes you shine. \nLantern making is a globally recognized art. Representing hope\, guidance\, and the triumph of light of darkness.
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/lotus-lanterns/
LOCATION:IN
CATEGORIES:Free Event
END:VEVENT
