 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>First Thursda
 ys showcase the diversity of arts and humanities at IU Bloomington and off
 er a welcoming environment for students\, faculty\, staff\, and community 
 members to explore new creative outlets. Each event is a unique opportunit
 y to experience the wonderful work of artists\, performers\, and scholars 
 from all across campus and around town.</p>\n<p>The April First Thursdays 
 will be a festival of art\, ideas\, and community featuring 2 performance 
 stages\, 80+ activity booths\, 20+ arts vendors\, food trucks\, giveaways\
 , and more. Around the IU Fine Arts Plaza\, there will be a 1776 Trail\, p
 oster printing\, 3D fabrication demos\, and henna tattooing among many oth
 er activities. On the main stage\, we’ll have performances by Soul Revue\,
  Eleanor & Dario\, Jacobs Saxophone Ensemble\, IU Musical Theatre\, and In
 Motion Dance Company. For more details\, visit <a href='https://artsandhum
 anities.indiana.edu/council-programs/first-thursdays/index.html' data-safe
