DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nCome to the IMU for
  a free book-signing lecture with the Executive Director of the Kinsey Ins
 titute\, the world&rsquo\;s leading sex research institute\, Dr. Justin Ga
 rcia. He will be talking about his new book\, The Intimate Animal: The Sci
 ence of Sex\, Fidelity\, and Why we Live and Die for Love. The lecture wil
 l be followed by a Q&amp\;A\, book signing\, and reception!&nbsp\; This ev
 ent is in partnership with the IU Bookstore. Complimentary food and free b
 ook giveaway included! 6pm - Lecture in Tudor Room Book signing in IU Book
 store following the lecture All Indiana University events\, groups\, activ
 ities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome al
 l IU students and other members of the Indiana University community.
