BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"WFHB Community Calendar": "https://wfhb.org/event/author-event-with-sven-becker/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wfhb
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
UID:ai1ec-147836@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260401T021218Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Author and Harvard professor Sven Beckert\, will be discussing 
 his latest book\, Capitalism: A Global History.\nABOUT THE BOOK:\nNo other
  phenomenon has shaped human history as decisively as capitalism. It struc
 tures how we live and work\, how we think about ourselves and others\, how
  we organize our politics.  Capitalism\, argues Beckert\, was born global.
   By chronicling capitalism’s global history\, Beckert exposes the reality
  of the system that now seems simply “natural.” Sven Beckert doesn’t merel
 y tote up capitalism’s debits and credits. He shows us how to look through
  and beyond it to imagine a different and larger world.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260403T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260403T190000
LOCATION:Morgenstern Books & Cafe\, 849 South Auto Mall Road\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Author event with Sven Becker
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/author-event-with-sven-becker/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>Aut
 hor and Harvard professor Sven Beckert\, will be discussing his latest boo
 k\, <em>Capitalism: A Global History</em>.</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>ABOUT THE BOO
 K:</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>No other phenomenon has shaped human history as decis
 ively as capitalism. It structures how we live and work\, how we think abo
 ut ourselves and others\, how we organize our politics.  Capitalism\, argu
 es Beckert\, was born global.  By chronicling capitalism’s global history\
 , Beckert exposes the reality of the system that now seems simply “natural
 .” Sven Beckert doesn’t merely tote up capitalism’s debits and credits. He
  shows us how to look through and beyond it to imagine a different and lar
 ger world.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
