 v8506693846'>\n<div>\n<div dir='ltr'>\n<p>BARC meetings are free to everyo
 ne\; all ages and backgrounds are invited. Meetings are the first non-holi
 day Friday of the month.</p>\n<p>For more information please contact BARC 
 President Tom Henderson\, amateur radio call sign W9YW —317-250-4646 or <a
  href='mailto:W9YW@ARRL.net' target='_blank' rel='nofollow noopener'>W9YW@
 ARRL.net</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</BODY>
