 0PM) from the IMU will be provided for free. This is also a returning prog
 ram (shoutout Goat Yoga in Spring 2024)! All Indiana University events\, g
 roups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observanc
 es welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University com
 munity.
