 m.</b> at <b>Morgenstern Books</b>\, located at 849 S Auto Mall Rd\, Bloomi
 ngton\, IN 47401<br><br>This event offers residents the chance to connect d
 irectly with City leaders\, ask questions\, and learn more about key projec
 ts and city services.<br><br>The evening will begin with brief updates from
  the Mayor\, followed by a Q&amp\;A session based on submitted questions. I
 f time allows\, the event will conclude with live questions from attendees.
