 onth as part of the City’s commitment to transparent\, accessible governmen
 t. Anyone interested in how city services are delivered is encouraged to at
 tend. The meeting will be broadcast live on Community Access Television Ser
 vices (CATS) and available for on-demand viewing at <a href="http://catstv.
 net" target="_blank">catstv.net</a>.
