DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: The Pre Black Law Students Association \n\nBallot v
 s. Bullet is an interactive event that explores the power of voting versus
  more radical forms of resistance in the fight for Black rights and social
  change. Inspired by Malcom Xs famous speech\, participants will step into
  the roles of historical figures and engage in discussions\, debates\, and
  scenarios that highlight different approaches to achieving justice. This 
 event encourages critical thinking about civic engagement\, activism\, and
  the impact of political participation in shaping our com
