DESCRIPTION:Community Healthcare Conversation — Meet the Candidates for US 
 House of Representatives District 9.\n\nThe discussion will focus on the cu
 rrent state of healthcare and how candidates would serve Hoosiers to addres
 s cuts to Medicaid\, loss of subsidies in the insurance Marketplace\, healt
 hcare for the uninsured\, hospital closures in Indiana\, and related concer
 ns.\n\nConfirmed candidates: Jim Graham\, Brad Meyer\, Dr. Tim Peck\, Floyd
  Taylor\, Keil Roark.\nNote: Current officeholder Rep. Erin Houchin has dec
 lined to participate.\n\nModerator: Dr. Mark Bauman\, retired Pathologist a
 nd Clinical Associate Professor (emeritus)\, IU School of Medicine. Dr. Bau
 man taught Pathology to medical students and Healthcare Policy to undergrad
 uates at Indiana University Bloomington.\n\nCo-sponsored by: Medicare for A
 ll Indiana – Bloomington\, League of Women Voters Bloomington-Monroe County
 \, Monroe County Branch NAACP\, League of Women Voters Brown County\, Brown
  Countians for Quality Healthcare\, The Rural Summit\, and Organizing India
 na.\n\nLocation: Garton Hall\, St. Mark's United Methodist Church
LAST-MODIFIED:20260324T133215Z
LOCATION:St Mark's United Methodist Church\, Garton Hall\, 100 IN-46\, Bloo
 mington\, IN 47408
