X-SOURCE-URLS:{"WFHB Community Calendar": "https://wfhb.org/event/the-davinci-code-presented-by-constellation-stage-screen-3/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wfhb
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
UID:ai1ec-140528@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260401T021218Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Dan Brown’s international best-seller comes to life on stage in
  this thrilling\, high-stakes adventure! When the curator of the Louvre is
  found murdered under mysterious circumstances\, symbologist Robert Langdo
 n and cryptologist Sophie Neveu are thrust into an investigation that quic
 kly unravels into a deadly conspiracy. As they follow a trail of cryptic p
 uzzles and ancient codes\, they discover a secret that could change the co
 urse of history. Packed with pulse-pounding suspense and stunning visuals\
 , The Da Vinci Code is an exhilarating journey into the unknown. Recommend
 ed for ages 13+. \nSee Constellation’s website for more information\, incl
 uding a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at http
 s://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/da-vinci-code/
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260408T193000
LOCATION:Waldron Arts Center. 122 S. Walnut Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The DaVinci Code presented by Constellation Stage & Screen
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-davinci-code-presented-by-constellation-stag
 e-screen-3/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>\n<p dir='l
 tr'>Dan Brown’s international best-seller comes to life on stage in this t
 hrilling\, high-stakes adventure! When the curator of the Louvre is found 
 murdered under mysterious circumstances\, symbologist Robert Langdon and c
 ryptologist Sophie Neveu are thrust into an investigation that quickly unr
 avels into a deadly conspiracy. As they follow a trail of cryptic puzzles 
 and ancient codes\, they discover a secret that could change the course of
  history. Packed with pulse-pounding suspense and stunning visuals\, <i>Th
 e Da Vinci Code</i> is an exhilarating journey into the unknown. <em>Recom
 mended for ages 13+. </em></p>\n<p dir='ltr'><em><span id='m_1615193731444
 661664gmail-docs-internal-guid-3527eff3-7fff-b724-c24a-9be2c7c6b581'>See C
 onstellation’s website for more information\, including a detailed perform
 ance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at <a href='https://seeconstell
 ation.org/mainstage/da-vinci-code/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferr
 er' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seeconstell
 ation.org/mainstage/da-vinci-code/&source=gmail&ust=1757532159062000&usg=A
 OvVaw2jKs-ps_l18YLifThXiJG8'>https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/da-vin
 ci-code/</a> </span></em></p>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
