X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU beINvolved Student Orgs": "https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12232651"}
X-SOURCE-ID:iu_campuslabs
SUMMARY:Sexual Assault Awareness Month Program
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T230000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12232651
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d3
 a75ebf-da21-4777-a8e1-9c4880d83acbb155f2c7-c3f2-4e08-b34d-dcdac8e1cc42.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: La Casa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nThis program aims
  to raise awareness about the impact of violence and abuse\, honor survivo
 rs&rsquo\; strength and resilience\, and provide a meaningful way to break
  the silence that so often surrounds these experiences. Interactive activi
 ty and refreshments provided.&nbsp\;Co-hosted:&nbsp\;OSVPVA and La Casa.
LOCATION:La Casa/Latino Cultural Center
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12232651
X-SOURCE:IU La Casa Latino Cultural Center, IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
