SUMMARY:La Casa Crafts Night
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T230000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12239398
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/94
 c7fdb9-85f0-45a3-9641-ccef0f0185ce657a0ebd-075f-42d8-b169-5a0b0a9d914e.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Office for Sexual Violence Prevention and Victim Ad
 vocacy\n\nJoin us for a cozy and empowering Sexual Assault Awareness Month
  (SAAM) themed Crafts Night at La Casa Cultural Center. This come-as-you-a
 re event invites students and community members to create meaningful art w
 hile reflecting on themes of healing\, consent\, resilience\, and solidari
 ty.&nbsp\;Interactive activity and refreshments provided. Co-hosted: OSVPV
 A and La Casa. All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educa
 tional\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and
  other members of the Indiana University community.
LOCATION:La Casa/ Latino Culture Center
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12239398
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
