DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260409T000000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12315747
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/3d
 c7e9f3-2a49-485a-bccf-d360b9008d9727689b23-a9c4-4069-98a6-1d0c35fd46dc.pdf
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: The Neurodiversity Coalition at IU\n\nJoin us for a
 n evening of listening to a curated playlist of songs by neurodivergent ar
 tists while doing some arts and crafts.&nbsp\; Snacks and refreshments wil
