BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU beINvolved Student Orgs": "https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12380717"}
X-SOURCE-ID:iu_campuslabs
SUMMARY:The Perks Of Being A Wallflower
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260409T000000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12380717
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/a7
 c27617-1266-4e61-a1a1-c38586ec6e82100ef5d7-e9b8-4a48-9d45-b4f1fdd96210.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: U Bring Change to Mind\n\nThe intent behind this mo
 vie night is to spread awareness about the difficulties of seasons and cha
 nges in life. Through the many themes throughout this movie\, it shines a 
 light on what it means to be yourself. As we go onwards from the season of
  April to May\, many things change and grow.&nbsp\; Embracing who you are 
 while still figuring out who you are is okay. It&rsquo\;s okay to not be o
 kay and it&rsquo\;s okay to accept the love you deserve. This movie also h
 ighlights past trauma and how it doesn&rsquo\;t define who you are\, but r
 ecognizing it can help you grow further through the upcoming seasons. Rese
 arch: &ldquo\;A number of research (e.g.\, Rodr&iacute\;guez et al.\, 2008
 \; Tinsley &amp\; Eldredge\, 1995) has shown that participation in leisure
  activities contributes to life satisfaction and SWB (Social Well Being)..
 .Studies have shown that leisure participation influences SWB via leisure 
 satisfaction based on psychological need theory and bottom-up mode
LOCATION:Ballantine Hall\, BLBH 330
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12380717
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
