SUMMARY:Hermanas Unidas (United Sisters)
DESCRIPTION:Hermanas Unidas at IUB is a space for Latinas to connect\, su
 pport one another\, and grow together. Build meaningful friendships\, str
 engthen community\, and have fun along the way. Join us and be part of so
 mething special.
