 7205ad-5662-4bca-bc6f-839d836695c72d2e75a2-6da8-4e55-ab43-b93ad9f598b7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Student Involvement and Leadership Center\n\nGettin
 g ready to pass the baton and ensure a smooth leadership transition in you
 r organization? This workshop is designed to current and incoming leaders&
 nbsp\; Set your student organization up for success with a smooth leadersh
 ip transition. This workshop is designed for current and incoming leaders 
 looking to maintain momentum\, share knowledge\, and lead confidently thro
 ugh change. Learn practical strategies for officer handoffs\, communicatio
 n\, goal setting\, and other tools for your organization's success. Connec
 t with fellow student leaders and campus partners\, including Student Invo
 lvement and Leadership\, UITS\, Student Legal Services\, and Supplier Data
  Management and leave with a game plan for your organization&rsquo\;s next
  chapter.
