  cakes from Sugar & Spice Bakery while a flute and harp duo from the Ja
 cobs School of Music performs live. Guests can also partake in spring-th
 emed crafts\, including making your own flower crown\, terrarium\, or na
 tural bird feeder\, as well as decorating garden tags and designing a cust
 om bouquet.\n\nDesigned for guests of all ages\, this event is the perfect
  opportunity to gather your friends\, family\, or significant other and ce
 lebrate together. Don’t miss out on the fun!
