X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  <strong>National Youth HIV/AIDS Awareness Day 
 Celebration</strong><br />\n  <strong>POZ Conversations: Bruce E. Smail\,
  M.A.</strong><br />\n  <strong>Tuesday\, April 9 | 5:00–6:30 p.m.</str
 ong><br />\n  <strong>IMU State Room East &amp\; West\, Indiana Universit
 y</strong>\n</p>
