 ta=l1SHeJmRnVt0jrwVlUu4hPSCHHSB0b5HMOT1WoE7jp8%3D&amp\;reserved=0" data-a
 uth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="0" data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody"
 &gt\;go.uic.edu/FETISHIZED  This event is part of 2026 Asian American and
  Pacific Islander Heritage Month.  All Indiana University events\, groups
 \, activities\, and&#160\;educational\, cultural\, and historical observa
 nces welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University 
 community.  &#160\;For more information\, view this event in BeInvolved (
