SUMMARY: Improv Bloomington: Live Comedy Show
DESCRIPTION:Improv Bloomington presents a night of fast-paced\, unscripte
 d comedy on Thursday\, April 9 at 7:30 PM at Blockhouse Bar (205 S Colleg
 e Ave). Like the TV show "Whose Line Is It Anyway?"\, everything is made 
 up on the spot based on audience suggestions. Doors open at 7:00 PM. Tick
 ets are $5 and seating is general admission. Get your tickets now at http
 s://improvbloomington.com/improv-show-april-9-2026/ https://improvbloomin
 gton.com/improv-show-april-9-2026/
CATEGORIES:
