UID:6f9975f0a29d707075544d977fdfe5ce@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Are you and your Little Hiker ready to wander the wetlands in 
 search of warblers and herons? Join us for a birding adventure as we learn
  how to spot birds using binoculars\, listen for different calls\, and exp
 lore the habitats where birds live. We’ll keep our eyes open for nests\,
  flashes of color\, and all the signs of birds around the wetlands. No bir
 ding experience is necessary\, and binoculars will be provided.
LOCATION:Beanblossom Bottoms Nature Preserve
URL:https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2026/03/little-hikers-birding-with-binos
 /
