DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring evening of dinner\, storytelling\, and
  community at this special Dinner Theater benefiting My Sister's Closet.\n\
 nGuests will enjoy a delicious buffet dinner at the Bloomington Country Clu
 b while experiencing powerful excerpts from "A Letter to My Daughter" by Ma
 ya Angelou\, performed by eight VIP Bloomington women.\n\nThroughout the ev
 ening\, attendees will hear inspiring client stories that highlight the imp
 act of My Sister's Closet and its mission to empower women in our community
 .\n\nThe event will also feature exciting live and silent auctions\, offeri
 ng guests the opportunity to further support this important work.\n\nTicket
  Prices: $85 individual | $1\,000 sponsored table\nMore info & tickets: htt
 p://sisterscloset.org/dinner\n\nContact: Elah Clark | elahclark0330@gmail.c
 om | 317-400-9721
