SUMMARY:Di:verse Dance Crew 2026 Senior Showcase
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T230000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T020000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/11606760
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/c1
 568e44-0b92-4853-9cc8-d191b80c7be8fcf4d386-b8f1-4cb7-bf70-b72daa3f5954.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Di:verse Dance Crew\n\nDi:verse Dance Crew will be 
 hosting their 5th annual Senior Showcase. The event will take place in Wil
 kie Auditorium on Saturday\, April 11th and starts at 7:30pm with the door
 s will opening at 7pm and closing at 10pm. There will be a variety of perf
 ormances this year\, including senior dances\, a full team dance\, and a f
 ew other subunits by our members and Board. There will also be free snacks
  and treats provided! &nbsp\; Make sure to RSVP through BeInvolved and our
