BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sycamore Land Trust": "https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2019/03/0419-patoka-birding-hike/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sycamore_land_trust
SUMMARY:Patoka River NWR Birding Hike
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T070000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T100000
UID:f05c53a85a24eb6ae90cde6830287333@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Join the Evansville Audubon Society for a birding walk through
  Boyd Woods at the Patoka River National Wildlife Refuge\, where Sycamore 
 protects 1\,200 acres at Columbia Mine Preserve. We&#8217\;ll search for w
 arblers and other migratory songbirds\, continuing the hike past Snakey Po
 int Marsh for possible views of waterfowl and marsh birds\, and ending at 
 a little-visited portion of Columbia Mine Preserve to look for grassland s
 parrows.
URL:https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2019/03/0419-patoka-birding-hike/
X-SOURCE:Sycamore Land Trust
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sycamore Land Trust": "https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2026/03/hike-the-trust-trevlac-bluffs-nature-preserve/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sycamore_land_trust
SUMMARY:Hike the Trust: Trevlac Bluffs Nature Preserve
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T090000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T110000
UID:13bce93626e3add1f2dbff359146066b@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:Part of our Hike the Trust series\, this guided hike will expl
 ore Trevlac Bluffs Nature Preserve\, where towering sandstone cliffs\, sha
 ded ravines\, and rare eastern hemlocks create a rugged landscape along th
 e Beanblossom Creek. Along the trail\, we’ll look for early spring wildf
 lowers and discover how geology and microclimates shape the unique plant c
 ommunities found here.
LOCATION:Trevlac Bluffs Nature Preserve
URL:https://sycamorelandtrust.org/2026/03/hike-the-trust-trevlac-bluffs-na
 ture-preserve/
X-SOURCE:Sycamore Land Trust
END:VEVENT
