 06428328ed/69c4596d701bd67becb476cf/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:No painter electrified the 1980s art scene like Jean
 -Michel Basquiat\, a New York street kid whose visionary blending of expr
 essionism\, pop art\, and the...
