 t IU Bloomington opportunities to enhance their mentoring\, teamwork\, and
  leadership skills.&nbsp\;Upon completion of MAP\, students receive a Cert
 ificate of Completion\, which establishes their commitment to growth and l
 eadership. All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educa
 tional\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and
