DESCRIPTION:Choose what matters most to you and celebrate your impact wit
 h the Hamilton Lugar School!  The campaign pages will be live from April 
 1 to April 22. Explore each story on April 1. We'll share the live campai
 gn links so you can make your gift.ProgramWhy SupportHamilton Lugar Schoo
 l Enrichment FundSupport the future global leaders through internships\, 
 study abroad\, and more at the Hamilton Lugar School.21st Century Japan P
 olitics and Society InitiativeShape future U.S.–Japan leaders through c
 oursework\, research\, and real-world engagement at IU.          African 
 Studies Program        Keep talented African scholars learning and leadin
 g with the African Student Aid Fund.          Center for Latin American a
 nd Caribbean Studies&#160\;        Build expertise and connections across
  Latin America and the Caribbean through language\, research\, and outrea
 ch.Center for the Study of the Middle EastPromote the understanding of Mi
 ddle Eastern languages and cultures in classrooms and communities across 
 Indiana.Chinese Flagship ProgramHelp IU students become global profession
 als and leaders through advanced Chinese study.          Department of Ce
 ntral Eurasian Studies        Support student research and preserve the d
 iverse cultures of Central Eurasia.          Department of East Asian Lan
 guages and Cultures        Power immersive language learning and global d
 iscovery in East Asia.          Department of International Studies      
   Open global doors—support student internships\, research\, and study 
 abroad.          Department of Middle Eastern Languages and Cultures     
    Help students explore Middle Eastern cultures through language study a
 nd travel.          Dhar India Studies Program        Fund student resear
 ch and IU's first immersive South Asia study abroad program.          Eas
 t Asian Studies Center        Send IU students to East Asia for life-chan
 ging internship experiences.          Inner Asian and Uralic National Res
 ource Center        Expand global learning from the Baltic to Mongolia—
 support IAUNRC's mission.          Institute for European Studies        
 Empower students and educators to make global impacts through EURO's tran
 sformative programs.          Institute for Korean Studies        Fuel st
 udy abroad\, research\, and innovative Korea-focused programming in India
 na.          Language Workshop                Empower students to master 
 critical languages and represent the U.S. worldwide.&#160\;              
   Modern Greek Program                Enrich classes and the community wi
 th Greek language and culture.                Mongolian Studies        Pr
 eserve and celebrate Mongolia's unique cultural heritage.          Polish
  Studies Center        Honor Timothy Wiles's legacy by advancing Polish c
 ulture and scholarship at IU through the Wiles Lecture. Meeting URL: http
 s://go.iu.edu/2026-hls-iuday
