X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County Playhouse": "https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/senior-movie-series-book-club/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:brown_county_playhouse
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260416T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260416T170000
DTSTAMP:20260331T221157
CREATED:20260330T143323Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260330T143323Z
UID:10001423-1776348000-1776358800@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:Senior Movie Series: Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Meredith Funeral Home\, in partnership with the historic Brown County Playhouse\, is excited to\noffer a Free Monthly Movie Series for those aged 60 and over. Enjoy a classic film with friends\, free\npopcorn\, and a soda—all in the comfort of the historic Brown County Playhouse! \n\nWhen:\nAPR 16\, 2026 – Book Club\nMay 21\, 2026 – Senior Moment\nTime: 2:00 p.m. Doors open at 1:00 p.m.\nWhere: Historic Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St. in Nashville\, IN\nNo ticket is necessary\, and admission is free for those 60 and over. For those under 60\, admission is just\n$7.\n\nThis initiative is part of the Meredith family’s ongoing commitment to giving back to the community. Bill\nand Jamie Meredith\, along with their dedicated staff\, are excited to create a monthly opportunity for\nseniors to connect with others and enjoy a time of fellowship. \nCelebrating 50 years of exceptional customer service\, Meredith Funeral Home remains locally\nowned and operated. Throughout these years\, they have earned the trust of the community by\nproviding compassionate\, dignified services at an affordable price. \nWe invite you to join us for an afternoon of movies\, community\, and memories. We look forward to\nseeing you at the Brown County Playhouse Senior Movie Series! \n  \n—————————————- \n\n\nFour lifelong friends have their lives forever changed after reading 50 Shades of Grey in their monthly book club. \n\n\n\n \nFREE EVENT FOR SENIORS OVER 60 - UNDER 60 CONTACT BOX OFFICE
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/senior-movie-series-book-club/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Movies
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/SR-MOVIE-BookClub-web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
