SUMMARY:Union Board LFB Presents: Help Us Feed Bloomington
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T000000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T033000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12310195
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/15
 fd22b6-1fc4-4a3d-9d57-81ab03dcde473a0bcd41-1dfb-49a3-a86d-0bdf12a211bd.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nThe program would i
 nvolve live music and performances from five bands in the Harmony School G
 ymnasium. It is meant as a way for Live from Bloomington to branch into co
 mmunity based venues and involve spaces that those who enjoy live music fe
 el more comfortable in. As well as this\, providing a promising venue for 
 local bands. With all of this\, there is a philanthropic goal of getting a
 ttendees to donate canned goods to hoosier hills food bank during the even
