 c\, food and drinks\, local vendors\, prize drawings\, tree giveaways\, and
  more. This event is hosted as a joint effort of the <a href="https://bloom
 ington.in.gov/departments/esd"><u>Department of Economic and Sustainable De
 velopment</u></a>\, <a href="https://gobloomington.org/"><u>Go Bloomington<
 /u></a>\, and the <a href="https://bloomington.in.gov/parks"><u>Parks and R
 ecreation Department</u></a>.<br><br>For details visit <a href="https://blo
 omington.in.gov/sustainability/earthday">https://bloomington.in.gov/sustain
 ability/earthday</a>
