CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Led by Artistic Director Caio Lopes\, the Bloomington Chamber S
 ingers present one of the great choral masterpieces of our age: Maurice Du
 ruflé’s transcendent Requiem. Combining Gregorian chant with lush modern h
 armonies\, this meditative and powerful work will be heard in its original
  chamber-orchestral version\, revealing its intimate and colorful soundsca
 pe.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T160000
LOCATION:Saint Mark's United Methodist Church\, 100 IN-46\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bloomington Chamber Singers: Durufle’s Requiem
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bloomington-chamber-singers-durufles-requiem/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Led by Artist
 ic Director Caio Lopes\, the Bloomington Chamber Singers present one of th
 e great choral masterpieces of our age: Maurice Duruflé’s transcendent <em
 >Requiem</em>. Combining Gregorian chant with lush modern harmonies\, this
  meditative and powerful work will be heard in its original chamber-orches
 tral version\, revealing its intimate and colorful soundscape.</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
