 nt_detail_block">\n  <p>\n    Join us for an exciting talk given by Hardv
 ard faculty fellow <strong>Judith Donath</strong>&#160\;as part of the "B
 eyond the Web" salon series piloted by Ostrom Workshop @ IU and the Hamil
 ton Lugar School.\n  </p>\n</div>
