X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU beINvolved Student Orgs": "https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12246700"}
X-SOURCE-ID:iu_campuslabs
SUMMARY:Pedals and Pours
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260423T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260423T200000Z
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12246700
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/7d
 6edc28-7b9a-4541-9d5c-ddd547f0d9a1a0a620ec-5974-422d-9b2d-9c50b858085c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: First Year & Family Experience Programs\n\nCelebrat
 e Wellness Week with a refreshing spin at Pedal &amp\; Pours. Join us for 
 a laid-back afternoon centered on movement\, hydration\, and a little Hoos
 ier nostalgia. We&rsquo\;ll be serving up ice-cold water (because wellness
  is the vibe) while we screen the classic cycling film Breaking Away. Whet
 her you&rsquo\;re a seasoned cyclist\, a casual rider\, or just here for t
 he good company\, this event is all about taking a pause\, filling your cu
 p (literally)\, and enjoying a feel-good story about determination\, frien
 dship\, and chasing big dreams on two wheels. Stop by\, grab a pour\, sett
 le in\, and coast into the afternoon with us.
LOCATION:Indiana Memorial Union- Frangipani Room
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12246700
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
