X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Questions can be directed to the museum v
 ia email (<a href="mailto:libwylie@iu.edu">libwylie@iu.edu</a>) or by pho
 ne\, (812)855-6224.\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Celebrate the publication of <em><a href="http
 s://iulibrariespublishing.iu.edu/making-IU/">Making Indiana University</a
 ></em>\, University Historian <a href="https://hpsc.indiana.edu/about/eme
 riti-faculty/capshew-james.html">Jim Capshew</a>'s new open-access histor
