 3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp\;sdata=vFI61%2Fso6eeqcTGNhsNVMIrIi1JMa8qf1hl8XlyIcLs%
 3D&amp\;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" data-auth="
 NotApplicable" data-linkindex="4">https://wheneveryoneswims.org/</a> to v
 iew the trailer and join the movement.</p><p>  This program is a partners
 hip between the School of Public Health\, IU Cinema\, and the Black Film 
 Center &amp\; Archive.</p>
