UID:a5962714b200e181a0248ff393610e2d@sycamorelandtrust.org
DESCRIPTION:A women-powered volunteer work day to help preserve native bio
 diversity and get hands-on experience in land stewardship!  Remove invasi
 ve garlic mustard and other invasive plants at Amy Weingartner Branigin Pe
 ninsula Preserve (7466 East Rush Ridge Road Bloomington\, IN 47401) follow
 ed by a guided hike led by Mary Welz of Sycamore Land Trust. After work is
  complete\, there will be a picnic by the water beginning around 5:15 pm. 
