SUMMARY:Global Health Scholars Day featuring Dr. Chandy John
DESCRIPTION:Global Health Scholars Day\, on Friday\, May 8\, showcases th
 e excellent work being done by the IU community to improve the care of pa
 tients worldwide\, research the complexities of global health\, and educa
 te learners about the care of local and global populations.  The event be
 gins with IU School of Medicine Department of Medicine Grand Rounds featu
 ring Dr. Chandy John presenting "How to change the world through science.
 "&#160\; Grand rounds will be delivered both in person at the Medical Edu
 cation and Research Building (MERB) Tiered Classroom 1019 and online thro
 ugh Zoom. Link will be shared with registrants.&#160\;Read more about Dr.
  John (https://medicine.iu.edu/blogs/pediatrics/chandy-john-advances-glob
 al-health-through-science-service-and-synergy)  Poster presentations and 
 the opportunity for those interested in global health throughout the univ
 ersity to network and share information will follow grand rounds.  Global
  Health Scholars Day is open to anyone at IU with an interest in global h
 ealth.  12-1 pm&#160\; Global Health Grand Rounds&#160\;  1-2 pm&#160\; &
 #160\; &#160\;Poster viewing and networking  Abstract deadline is April 3
 . Learn more and submit an abstract. (http://redcap.uits.iu.edu/surveys/?
 s=37J3DKYM9XCTXXDD)&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Global Health Scholars Day\, on Friday\
 , May 8\, showcases the excellent work being done by the IU community to 
 improve the care of patients worldwide\, research the complexities of glo
 bal health\, and educate learners about the care of local and global popu
 lations.</p><p>  The event begins with IU School of Medicine Department o
 f Medicine Grand Rounds featuring Dr. Chandy John presenting "How to chan
 ge the world through science."&#160\; Grand rounds will be delivered both
  in person at the Medical Education and Research Building (MERB) Tiered C
 lassroom 1019 and online through Zoom. Link will be shared with registran
 ts.&#160\;</p><p><strong><a href="https://medicine.iu.edu/blogs/pediatric
 s/chandy-john-advances-global-health-through-science-service-and-synergy"
  target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read more about Dr. John</a></strong></p>
 <p>  Poster presentations and the opportunity for those interested in glo
 bal health throughout the university to network and share information wil
 l follow grand rounds.</p><p>  Global Health Scholars Day is open to anyo
 ne at IU with an interest in global health.</p><p>  12-1 pm&#160\; Global
  Health Grand Rounds&#160\;</p><p>  1-2 pm&#160\; &#160\; &#160\;Poster v
 iewing and networking</p><p>  Abstract deadline is April 3. <strong><a hr
