DESCRIPTION:<u></u>If no ride is listed\, then riders should feel free to c
 hoose a suitable route.<br><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, modera
 te-paced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride calend
 ar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an overall 
 average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a little ov
 er 30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the distance s
 cale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </span><br><br>No
 n-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistered.com/
 get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial membership<
 /a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signin
 g a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><br><u></u>
