DESCRIPTION:Tails on the Town\, presented by Scout’s Honor\, is Monroe Coun
 ty Humane Association’s signature spring event. It is a carnival-themed ev
 ening for adults that brings together animal lovers to support pets in our
  community.\n\nThe event includes carnival style games\, raffles\, great f
 ood\, drinks\, live and silent auctions\, dancing\, and music with DJShawn
 D. Guests enjoy a high energy atmosphere while connecting with others who 
 care about pets and families in our community. All proceeds benefit progra
 ms and services at Monroe County Humane Association.\n\nTails on the Town 
 is a 21 and older event. Come as you are in casual attire or dress up and 
 join the fun. Either way\, you will fit right in!
