DESCRIPTION:Discardia Mending-Day meets at the Monroe County Public Library
 \, 303 East Kirkwood\, monthly on 2nd Saturdays from noon to 4pm. Bring you
 r sewing\, interest in sewing\, interest to learn\, willingness to teach\, 
 or just bring pre-washed fabric items in need of mending or alteration! We 
 fix and alter garments and other fabric items for free\, as a service to th
 e greater community\, for fun! Let's keep things useful and out of the land
 fill together!
