X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Revolution &amp\; Reflection: Campus Experienc
 es in Art\, History\, and Ideas is an arts plaza invitation to everyone t
 o imagine the people and ideas of the United States of America at its fou
 nding and as it expanded west.\n</p>
