UID:1iu23ovc21iuitcjhgsp51pjhk@google.com_20260805
CREATED:20250922T201508Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><br></p><p><b>Bring Lights! Bring Lights! Bring Lights!</b><
 /p><p>These rides feature gravel roads\, single and double track trails\, a
 nd just enough pavement to string the aforementioned together into fun\, wo
 odsy adventure loops.  Rides begin at 6PM through the Fall and Winter month
 s as weather allows and typically last about two hours. Lights are mandator
 y as we enter the Fall and Winter seasons.</p><p>Routes are suitable for mo
 untain bike or gravel bike\, with some more turned to one or the other.  Ri
 des begin at different locations\, primarily associated with Yellowwood Sta
 te Forest\, Brown County State Park\, and the Hoosier National Forest in Mo
 nroe\, Lawrence\, and Brown Counties. Specific routes may be dictated by we
 ather conditions\, but starting locations\, route maps\, and gps file links
  will be posted here in advance.</p><p>Expect a lot of trees and few cars</
 p><p>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregister
 ed.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, good f
 or up to three rides\, and which includes electronically signing a liabilit
 y waiver\, prior to participation.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260323T130057Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Growlers Off Road Adventure Ride
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
