 sehold goods\, and more.  \n\nWant a booth space? Sign up online by choosin
 g either an indoor or outdoor booth\; spaces are approximately 10x10 each\;
  vendors may reserve up to three booth spaces each. Indoor spaces sell out 
 quickly! Outdoor spaces are on the brick plaza on the north side of the Pav
 ilion. Registration for the August Junk in the Trunk will open at 8am on Ma
 y 4\, 2026
