 n you can use for the calendar event:</p><p><b>Description:</b>Join a walki
 ng club with other dog lovers to learn how to walk trails with your dog! Th
 is event will teach your dog healthy interactions\, good leash-walking habi
 ts\, and safe trail walking.</p><ul><li><p><b>When:</b> Meets promptly at 9
  a.m. on the last Saturday of each month (weather permitting).</p></li><li>
 <p><b>What to bring:</b> Your dog\, a leash\, and good walking shoes.</p></
 li><li><p><b>Details:</b> Registration is not required\; this is an open an
 d free event. The walk takes place on the trails through the woods surround
 ing the clinic.</p></li></ul>
